==Miscellaneous==
*New [[User Rank]] Rewards:
**4,750 grants 5 Green Catfruit.
**4,800 grants 5 Purple Catfruit.
**4,850 grants 5 Red Catfruit.
**4,900 grants 5 Blue Catfruit.
**4,950 grants 5 Yellow Catfruit.
**5,000 grants 5 Epic Catfruit.
**5,050 increases level cap to +65 for [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]].
**5,100 increases level cap to +70 for [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]].
**5,150 grants 1 Rare Ticket.
*[[Daboo of the Dead]]'s effective range changed from 0~800 to -700~800.
*Removed [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] type from [[The Face]], [[Mooth]], [[Teacher Bun Bun]], [[Owlbrow]], [[Yurinchi (Enemy)|Yurinchi]], [[Princess Head]], [[White Cyclone]], [[Crazed Bird Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Bird Cat]], [[Beefcake Cat (Enemy)|Beefcake Cat]], [[Flying Ninja Cat (Enemy)|Flying Ninja Cat]] and [[Manic Flying Cat (Enemy)|Manic Flying Cat]].

